%N A083490 Multiples of 2 in which there is no common digit in successive terms.
%C A083490 a(n) even, a(n) has no digits in common with a(n-1).
%H A083490 <a href="/index/Rec#order_10">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, signature (0,1,0,0,0,0,0,10,0,-10).
%F A083490 From _Elmo R. Oliveira_, Aug 04 2026: (Start)
%F A083490 a(n) = a(n-2) + 10*a(n-8) - 10*a(n-10) for n > 15.
%F A083490 G.f.: 2*(1 + 2*x + 2*x^2 + 2*x^3 + 2*x^4 + 7*x^5 + 10*x^6 + 10*x^7 - 10*x^9 - 10*x^10 - 10*x^11 - 10*x^12 - 55*x^13 + 5*x^14 + 50*x^15) / ((1 - x^2)*(1 - 10*x^8)). (End)
%Y A083490 Cf. A083491, A083492, A083493, A083494, A083495, A083496, A083497.
